WEBVTT

00:00:09.292 --> 00:00:10.917
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:00:10.917 --> 00:00:12.875
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:00:16.292 --> 00:00:17.875
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:19.708
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:23.375
<i>Shake it love, YES!</i>

00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:26.917
<i>I'm going crazy with longing</i>

00:00:26.917 --> 00:00:28.542
<i>Brushing back my hair</i>

00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:30.583
<i>That got wet in an instant</i>

00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:33.250
<i>Being toyed with by the warm rain</i>

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:36.750
<i>Shall I see how far I can run?</i>

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.708
<i>The prayer</i>

00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:40.708
<i>That spun out</i>

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:43.625
<i>Connects to the future</i>

00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:44.542
<i>Overflowing</i>

00:00:44.542 --> 00:00:46.042
<i>The miracle of love</i>

00:00:46.042 --> 00:00:47.958
<i>The wonderful miracle</i>

00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:50.750
<i>The voice of these six flowers</i>

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.958
<i>is released! (Shake it love, SAY!)</i>

00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:54.792
<i>Pulling toward each other (So fast!)</i>

00:00:54.792 --> 00:00:56.458
<i>That power (So vast!)</i>

00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:58.750
<i>I want it to reach you</i>

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:00.042
<i>Don't stop the music</i>

00:01:00.042 --> 00:01:01.875
<i>High in the night sky (So high!)</i>

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:03.958
<i>I send up my excitement (Turn round!)</i>

00:01:03.958 --> 00:01:06.417
<i>Gravitic-romantic</i>

00:01:06.417 --> 00:01:07.208
<i>Tonight</i>

00:01:07.208 --> 00:01:08.875
<i>Can't be stopped (Nonstop!)</i>

00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:10.708
<i>The impulse of love (Get down!)</i>

00:01:10.708 --> 00:01:13.833
<i>I want to mess you up</i>

00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:15.542
<i>T-T-Take it easy now!</i>

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.167
<i>To embrace you</i>

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:18.833
<i>a-a-as I feel it</i>

00:01:18.833 --> 00:01:19.583
<i>Let's dance</i>

00:01:19.583 --> 00:01:22.833
<i>And once you're captivated, kiss!</i>

00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:24.583
<i>Good love! Good love!</i>

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:26.958
<i>Gravitic-love!</i>

00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:28.750
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.667
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:01:31.833 --> 00:01:34.125
<i>Shake it love, YES!</i>

00:01:37.583 --> 00:01:42.167
"Night of Overlapping Patterns"

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:57.292
You and my families are friends,
so we've known each other since birth.

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:01.042
Ever since we were little,

00:02:01.042 --> 00:02:05.375
I've always admired You for
being able to easily do what I couldn't do.

00:02:08.083 --> 00:02:13.000
He was always at the center of the class,
surrounded by lots of friends.

00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:21.250
Just like what his name means,
You was like the sun.

00:02:49.083 --> 00:02:50.000
Hey.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.917
You, do you have a minute?

00:02:51.917 --> 00:02:53.333
Yeah.

00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:55.167
Sure, what's up?

00:02:55.167 --> 00:02:57.292
Oh, is that the TV show you're gonna be in?

00:02:57.292 --> 00:02:57.875
"The Measure of Youth"

00:02:57.875 --> 00:02:59.083
"The Measure of Youth"
Yeah.

00:03:00.458 --> 00:03:04.750
I saw the proposal for it.
It's an unusual part for you, isn't it?

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:07.833
The character's kind of a bad boy, right?

00:03:07.833 --> 00:03:11.208
That's his charm that draws
the heroine in, though.

00:03:11.208 --> 00:03:12.917
You're probably better for the part.

00:03:12.917 --> 00:03:16.958
I don't like saying it myself, but I agree.

00:03:18.042 --> 00:03:22.917
But isn't it a good experience as an actor?

00:03:22.917 --> 00:03:25.875
Do your best. I'll do what I can to help.

00:03:25.875 --> 00:03:27.375
Thanks.

00:03:27.375 --> 00:03:29.583
Actually, there's something already.

00:03:29.583 --> 00:03:32.458
Do you have any pictures
of yourself from junior high?

00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:33.875
Huh?

00:03:33.875 --> 00:03:39.292
After reading the script, the character
felt close to how you were during that time,

00:03:39.292 --> 00:03:45.083
so I wanted to see how you wore your uniform
and how you stood to help get into the part...

00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:49.333
But I don't really have any
pictures from junior high.

00:03:49.333 --> 00:03:50.917
Oh...

00:03:52.708 --> 00:03:54.833
It's not like I mean anything by that!

00:03:59.375 --> 00:04:04.875
Here. I think they should be
around here, so take what you want.

00:04:04.875 --> 00:04:05.917
Thanks.

00:04:05.917 --> 00:04:08.042
I'll bring some drinks.

00:04:08.042 --> 00:04:10.125
I wonder if he's being considerate...

00:04:12.417 --> 00:04:14.375
You's face was great here.

00:04:14.375 --> 00:04:16.708
I wonder if Mattsun forced him to take this?

00:04:20.875 --> 00:04:23.375
"The Sun Sets on a Faraway Mountain"

00:04:25.125 --> 00:04:28.042
He still had this...?

00:04:31.083 --> 00:04:36.125
You and I were always together,
but our relationship changed in junior high.

00:04:37.375 --> 00:04:39.375
We were in different classes,

00:04:39.375 --> 00:04:42.917
but even so, we still went to school
and came home together at first,

00:04:42.917 --> 00:04:46.833
and both of us would go visit
the other's classroom occasionally.

00:04:48.625 --> 00:04:50.917
I don't know when it happened,

00:04:50.917 --> 00:04:53.250
but we started going home separately.

00:04:54.875 --> 00:04:57.375
And one day, when I went
to get him in the morning,

00:04:57.375 --> 00:04:59.583
You had already left.

00:05:01.708 --> 00:05:05.167
I couldn't bring myself to ask him "Why?"

00:05:05.167 --> 00:05:06.583
and that was the end...

00:05:11.792 --> 00:05:13.250
Thinking back on it now,

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.083
I don't think the reason was a big deal,

00:05:15.083 --> 00:05:17.417
and there wasn't any deep meaning behind it.

00:05:18.375 --> 00:05:21.667
But to me at that time,

00:05:21.667 --> 00:05:25.167
that was something significant,

00:05:25.167 --> 00:05:29.042
and You seemed like he had turned
into someone out of my reach...

00:05:29.042 --> 00:05:30.458
I was lonely.

00:05:49.083 --> 00:05:52.083
"Year 3 Class 1"
"Yoru Nagatsuki You Haduki"

00:06:16.458 --> 00:06:18.667
We're in the same class, huh?

00:06:18.667 --> 00:06:19.875
Look forward to working with you.

00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:21.292
Yeah...

00:06:26.333 --> 00:06:27.125
You!

00:06:27.125 --> 00:06:29.125
In the same class again? All right.

00:06:29.125 --> 00:06:30.375
Yeah.

00:06:46.208 --> 00:06:48.458
If Haduki goes, then I'll go.

00:06:48.458 --> 00:06:49.833
Then You, you're going, too.

00:06:49.833 --> 00:06:52.833
Huh? I thought I said I wasn't going today.

00:06:52.833 --> 00:06:54.833
You're pretty antisocial, huh?

00:06:54.833 --> 00:07:00.000
Come on, my friend said she wanted to meet you.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.625
I guess I have no choice.

00:07:18.292 --> 00:07:19.542
Hey, Yoru!

00:07:19.542 --> 00:07:20.500
Mattsun!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:25.000
Don't sigh! Are you okay with
your happiness running off with your sighs?

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.458
What's up?

00:07:26.458 --> 00:07:29.333
I came to return You's textbook...

00:07:29.333 --> 00:07:30.833
...but he's not here, huh?

00:07:30.833 --> 00:07:32.917
Yoru, can you return it for me?

00:07:32.917 --> 00:07:33.875
Huh?

00:07:33.875 --> 00:07:39.000
But... I don't really talk to You...

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.583
You really never change, huh?

00:07:41.583 --> 00:07:44.958
You guys were so close in elementary school.

00:07:44.958 --> 00:07:48.417
You has a lot of other friends besides me.

00:07:48.417 --> 00:07:51.833
Oh, that crowd that's always messing around?

00:07:51.833 --> 00:07:55.042
You's definitely one of the popular kids.

00:07:55.042 --> 00:07:57.708
I'm jealous of how popular he is.

00:07:57.708 --> 00:07:59.708
You're amazing, Mattsun.

00:07:59.708 --> 00:08:03.083
You can talk to You like nothing's
changed since elementary school.

00:08:03.083 --> 00:08:06.792
Oh, you're thinking too hard
and acting too formal.

00:08:06.792 --> 00:08:10.292
If you stay like that, you won't
be able to make a hundred friends!

00:08:10.292 --> 00:08:14.833
Well, school's the kind of place where
you're practically a different species

00:08:14.833 --> 00:08:16.917
if your friends are different.

00:08:16.917 --> 00:08:18.708
That's true.

00:08:18.708 --> 00:08:20.292
But are you really okay with this?

00:08:20.292 --> 00:08:22.375
If you stay this way until graduation,

00:08:22.375 --> 00:08:26.167
won't it really be like you guys
are living on different planets?

00:08:31.458 --> 00:08:34.333
Even if you tell me that...

00:08:34.333 --> 00:08:37.292
Living on different planets, huh?

00:08:37.292 --> 00:08:39.792
But back then, too...

00:08:41.333 --> 00:08:44.167
Stop. Nagatsuki, are you singing?

00:08:44.167 --> 00:08:45.750
Um, yes!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:49.375
With that voice, you'll lose to the others.

00:08:49.375 --> 00:08:51.458
Let's sing more energetically!

00:08:53.292 --> 00:08:55.292
Now, once more.

00:09:09.125 --> 00:09:10.583
Don't you cry.

00:09:10.583 --> 00:09:12.208
I'm not crying...

00:09:12.208 --> 00:09:14.542
...but the test is coming up...

00:09:14.542 --> 00:09:15.875
You look like you're <i>about </i>to cry.

00:09:15.875 --> 00:09:18.375
You're lucky you're good at singing, You.

00:09:18.375 --> 00:09:20.667
You're not bad either, Yoru.

00:09:20.667 --> 00:09:23.208
You should sing louder.

00:09:23.208 --> 00:09:24.667
But...

00:09:24.667 --> 00:09:26.875
You're so negative.

00:09:26.875 --> 00:09:29.250
I like your voice.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.750
You...

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:31.708
I know!

00:09:31.708 --> 00:09:34.000
Let's practice together at
my house every day from now on!

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:35.542
I'll help you!

00:09:35.542 --> 00:09:37.375
What? You will?

00:09:37.375 --> 00:09:39.833
Yeah! I love singing!

00:09:39.833 --> 00:09:41.917
I could sing all day!

00:09:47.083 --> 00:09:51.208
I never worried about stuff like this before...

00:09:55.292 --> 00:09:55.792
"Culture Festival
Choir Practice Schedule"

00:09:55.792 --> 00:09:59.250
Here's the sheet music for the song
we're singing for the culture festival.

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:01.500
We'll be practicing after school
every day starting today.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:03.542
--What?
--Aw...

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.208
"The Sun Sets on a Faraway Mountain"

00:10:07.208 --> 00:10:08.625
"The Sun Sets on a Faraway Mountain"
This song is...

00:10:21.333 --> 00:10:22.917
You.

00:10:22.917 --> 00:10:25.875
We have choir practice after this, right?

00:10:25.875 --> 00:10:27.042
Are you staying?

00:10:27.042 --> 00:10:30.667
Huh? What's this?
You're friends with Nagatsuki, You?

00:10:30.667 --> 00:10:32.000
Uh, well--

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:35.667
Yoru, then you wanna be friends with us, too?

00:10:35.667 --> 00:10:37.083
We're fun.

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:39.917
U-Um...

00:10:39.917 --> 00:10:41.250
Stop it.

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:43.042
Don't force it.

00:10:46.208 --> 00:10:47.167
Let's go.

00:10:47.167 --> 00:10:48.250
'Kay.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.833
What? Sorry, Nagatsuki.

00:10:51.708 --> 00:10:53.250
Hey, Haduki! Guys!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.667
We have choir practice!

00:10:54.667 --> 00:10:57.292
My stomach hurts, so I'm skipping today.

00:10:57.292 --> 00:10:59.000
Ask again tomorrow!

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.500
Choir practice is boring, anyway.

00:11:02.292 --> 00:11:02.792
Hey!

00:11:02.792 --> 00:11:04.167
Here, we're returning this!

00:11:05.458 --> 00:11:07.083
Let's go, You.

00:11:07.083 --> 00:11:08.125
You're the worst.

00:11:08.125 --> 00:11:10.542
Just leave them.

00:11:10.542 --> 00:11:11.333
Where do you wanna go?

00:11:11.333 --> 00:11:12.708
Let's go karaoke.

00:11:24.167 --> 00:11:33.958
♪ The sun sets on a faraway mountain ♪

00:11:33.958 --> 00:11:36.458
"The Sun Sets on a Faraway Mountain"
This voice...

00:11:36.458 --> 00:11:48.917
♪ The sky is studded with stars ♪

00:11:48.917 --> 00:12:01.625
♪ I've finished today's work ♪

00:12:16.917 --> 00:12:19.833
Let's see... I think it was around here...

00:12:20.958 --> 00:12:22.375
Found it!

00:12:54.292 --> 00:12:55.375
Hey, Yoru!

00:12:55.375 --> 00:12:56.250
Mattsun!

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.875
Perfect timing! Can I borrow
your English-Japanese dictionary?

00:12:58.875 --> 00:13:02.125
Sure, you can just take it.

00:13:02.125 --> 00:13:03.542
Have you seen You?

00:13:03.542 --> 00:13:04.542
You?

00:13:04.542 --> 00:13:07.708
He went up those stairs just now.

00:13:07.708 --> 00:13:08.833
Thanks!

00:13:08.833 --> 00:13:09.792
Sure!

00:13:09.792 --> 00:13:11.792
I don't know what's going on,
but do your best!

00:13:16.167 --> 00:13:17.375
You!

00:13:18.583 --> 00:13:20.000
Yoru.

00:13:20.917 --> 00:13:22.417
Did you need something?

00:13:22.417 --> 00:13:24.125
Sorry to bother you.

00:13:24.125 --> 00:13:25.792
I wanted to give this to you...

00:13:28.333 --> 00:13:29.417
This is...

00:13:29.417 --> 00:13:32.292
It's from elementary school,
so it's falling apart...

00:13:32.292 --> 00:13:33.750
...but if you'd like...

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.250
Come to choir practice today.

00:13:37.583 --> 00:13:39.167
You, you ready yet?

00:13:39.167 --> 00:13:41.708
Let's get out of here.

00:13:43.125 --> 00:13:45.333
I told you, I want to be alone!

00:13:45.333 --> 00:13:46.917
Wait downstairs!

00:13:46.917 --> 00:13:50.792
Oh? Nagatsuki, meddling again?

00:13:50.792 --> 00:13:52.917
You really like You a lot, huh?

00:13:52.917 --> 00:13:54.458
What are you, his mom?

00:13:54.458 --> 00:13:55.250
Hey.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:58.083
Look, will you stop hanging around him?

00:13:58.083 --> 00:14:00.083
You doesn't like it, either.

00:14:00.083 --> 00:14:02.042
--I--!
--I don't need anyone's permission

00:14:02.042 --> 00:14:04.167
to hang around You.

00:14:04.167 --> 00:14:05.833
I can do what I want.

00:14:05.833 --> 00:14:07.958
Oh, is he mad now?

00:14:07.958 --> 00:14:10.583
That's scary. Let's go, You.

00:14:14.375 --> 00:14:15.792
Scram, you guys!

00:14:16.542 --> 00:14:18.167
I said scram!

00:14:18.167 --> 00:14:20.083
Let's go.

00:14:20.083 --> 00:14:21.583
What's <i>his </i>problem?

00:14:24.333 --> 00:14:26.500
Th... Thanks...

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:29.292
What're you getting angry about?
Just ignore them!

00:14:29.292 --> 00:14:31.750
If those guys have their eye on a guy like you,

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:34.417
it'll definitely be annoying!

00:14:34.417 --> 00:14:35.833
Sorry.

00:14:41.917 --> 00:14:45.917
But, don't you want to sing, You?

00:14:45.917 --> 00:14:49.333
What the heck? Why are you bothering?

00:14:49.333 --> 00:14:51.500
I don't care about you or singing.

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.083
Liar! You're a liar!

00:14:54.083 --> 00:14:55.708
You're different from me.

00:14:55.708 --> 00:14:57.792
You can do whatever you want
if you put your mind to it,

00:14:57.792 --> 00:15:00.458
but right now you're acting tough
and not doing what you want!

00:15:00.458 --> 00:15:03.375
Singing by yourself with that
pained look on your face!

00:15:03.375 --> 00:15:05.708
It's not cool at all!

00:15:08.417 --> 00:15:11.417
I don't care who you hang around with.

00:15:11.417 --> 00:15:15.000
I don't care if you think I'm a bother.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:19.125
But I don't want you to lie to yourself!

00:15:20.708 --> 00:15:23.708
I like the cool You better!

00:15:28.875 --> 00:15:41.417
<i>I'll let my heart rest peacefully</i>
<i>     </i>

00:15:41.417 --> 00:15:53.625
<i>The wind is cool tonight</i>
<i>      </i>

00:15:53.625 --> 00:16:06.083
<i>Come, let's have a fun gathering</i>
<i>      </i>

00:16:06.083 --> 00:16:12.167
♪ A fun gathering ♪

00:16:40.875 --> 00:16:42.750
Okay, split up into your parts!

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:44.208
We'll start practice now!

00:16:44.208 --> 00:16:46.167
Okay!

00:16:46.167 --> 00:16:48.833
Sorry! What part am I?

00:16:48.833 --> 00:16:51.375
Huh? Um, that one--

00:16:54.458 --> 00:16:57.500
What? You're the one who told me to come.

00:17:11.042 --> 00:17:11.542
"Music Room"

00:17:11.542 --> 00:17:23.667
"Music Room"
♪ The sun sets on a faraway mountain ♪

00:17:23.667 --> 00:17:36.250
♪ The sky is studded with stars ♪

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:48.500
♪ I've finished today's work ♪

00:17:48.500 --> 00:18:01.000
♪ I'll let my heart rest peacefully ♪

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:13.500
♪ The wind is cool tonight ♪

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:25.917
♪ Come, let's have a fun gathering ♪

00:18:25.917 --> 00:18:31.958
♪ A fun gathering ♪

00:18:48.375 --> 00:18:50.375
Don't you cry.

00:18:54.667 --> 00:18:56.375
I'm not crying.

00:18:57.708 --> 00:18:59.333
I see.

00:19:01.458 --> 00:19:06.708
Neither You nor I talk much about that time.

00:19:08.292 --> 00:19:10.333
Because it was a little embarrassing,

00:19:10.333 --> 00:19:15.542
but it's a precious memory
that we want to keep safe.

00:19:16.458 --> 00:19:20.333
Now that we work together, I understand.

00:19:20.333 --> 00:19:22.500
Even though it was only a few years ago,

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:26.375
Yoru and I were both so young.

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:29.417
You couldn't be honest with himself,

00:19:29.417 --> 00:19:32.917
and I didn't have enough courage.

00:19:32.917 --> 00:19:37.583
But I actually wanted to
talk to you the whole time,

00:19:37.583 --> 00:19:40.833
to laugh together like we had in the past.

00:19:41.625 --> 00:19:45.792
I understood that the moment
our voices came together.

00:19:50.667 --> 00:19:51.917
"Graduation Ceremony"

00:19:53.667 --> 00:19:54.750
"Diploma"

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:57.375
"Diploma"
That's why, now...

00:19:58.708 --> 00:20:03.708
"Congrats on graduating!"

00:20:09.792 --> 00:20:11.500
Did you find the pictures?

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:13.042
Oh, yeah.

00:20:13.042 --> 00:20:15.583
Whoa, that takes me back!

00:20:16.792 --> 00:20:18.625
I kept something like this?

00:20:19.083 --> 00:20:19.792
You.

00:20:19.792 --> 00:20:21.167
Huh?

00:20:21.167 --> 00:20:25.000
We're okay now, right?

00:20:27.917 --> 00:20:33.458
Idiot, I never want to go through <i>that </i>again.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.542
"New TV Series Special"

00:20:38.833 --> 00:20:42.208
The TV show Yoru's in is airing tonight, right?

00:20:43.625 --> 00:20:46.042
Everyone came to watch, huh?

00:20:46.042 --> 00:20:48.375
It's a little embarrassing...

00:20:48.375 --> 00:20:51.667
I heard you used the old You
to help get into character?

00:20:51.667 --> 00:20:54.292
Just to get the feel of it.

00:20:54.292 --> 00:20:58.000
For some reason,
Mattsun called me about it earlier, too.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:21:01.625
"I heard you're the model
for Yoru's character tonight?

00:21:01.625 --> 00:21:03.875
I'll definitely watch it and
tease you about it later!"

00:21:03.875 --> 00:21:06.125
he said.

00:21:06.125 --> 00:21:08.250
Oh, it's starting!

00:21:11.292 --> 00:21:12.542
Wait!

00:21:12.542 --> 00:21:14.375
Shut up! Leave me alone!

00:21:14.375 --> 00:21:16.500
I don't care about you at all!

00:21:17.917 --> 00:21:20.833
--Was I that terrible?
--That's a lie, isn't it...?

00:21:20.833 --> 00:21:21.917
--Was I that terrible?
--No, it's not.

00:21:21.917 --> 00:21:24.917
--Um, that's a new frontier for Yoru, huh?
--How can you say that?

00:21:24.917 --> 00:21:26.042
--Um, that's a new frontier for Yoru, huh?
--'Cause you're annoying!

00:21:26.042 --> 00:21:27.625
--Yeah.
--'Cause you're annoying!

00:21:27.625 --> 00:21:29.667
You know how I feel!

00:21:29.667 --> 00:21:31.167
"Mattsun - That show"
"Mattsun - Yoru's amazing! It can't be anyone but You."

00:21:31.167 --> 00:21:33.958
"Shut up!"

00:21:33.958 --> 00:21:35.667
"Shut up!"
"Mattsun - It's great (lol)"

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:38.167
What the heck's wrong with everybody?!

00:21:38.167 --> 00:21:39.750
Now, now.

00:21:55.708 --> 00:22:01.667
<i>Noblesse soleil crossing the open sky,</i>
<i>noble and strong</i>

00:22:01.667 --> 00:22:07.542
<i>Simply, what it wants is a passionate heart</i>

00:22:07.542 --> 00:22:13.500
<i>Sweetly Noblesse soleil,</i>
<i>a heart aiming for the heavens</i>

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:19.833
<i>Shining moon, almost full moon,</i>
<i>are you feeling lucky?</i>

00:22:19.833 --> 00:22:24.958
<i>Once more unto the breach, a king in your heart</i>

00:22:24.958 --> 00:22:30.625
<i>Pretending not to see the fear of falling</i>

00:22:30.625 --> 00:22:36.458
<i>A completely free world</i>
<i>that no one has ever seen</i>

00:22:36.458 --> 00:22:42.375
<i>We want to choose the high, faraway heights</i>

00:22:42.375 --> 00:22:48.333
<i>If I manage to take even your fingertips,</i>
<i>I won't let go for anything</i>

00:22:48.333 --> 00:22:51.292
<i>That's what we chosen ones are</i>

00:22:51.292 --> 00:22:55.583
<i>We Few, We Happy Few</i>

00:23:11.917 --> 00:23:13.625
"Episode 10: Blue Flame"

00:23:13.625 --> 00:23:15.417
"Episode 10: Blue Flame"
I'm Aoi Satsuki!

00:23:15.417 --> 00:23:17.083
"Episode 10: Blue Flame"
Apparently, they're going to film a

00:23:17.083 --> 00:23:19.458
"Episode 10: Blue Flame"
candid morning call at the Tsukino dorms,

00:23:19.458 --> 00:23:20.583
"Episode 10: Blue Flame"
and Koi and I have been

00:23:20.583 --> 00:23:23.750
"Episode 10: Blue Flame"
appointed as the reporters.

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:27.625
I'm not used to being on
variety shows, so I'm nervous,

00:23:27.625 --> 00:23:30.333
but this is an important job, too.

00:23:30.333 --> 00:23:32.583
I'll give it my all!

00:23:32.583 --> 00:23:35.417
Next time, "Blue Flame!"

00:23:35.417 --> 00:23:42.059
Koi, you don't have to get <i>that</i>
fired up, you know...
